<title>UK: Saudi cuts April Arab Light crude to Europe 10 cts.</title>
<headline>Saudi cuts April Arab Light crude to Europe 10 cts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabian Aramco cut the price of its Arab Light crude to European term lifters in April by 10 cents per barrel to Dated Brent -$1.95, a European trader said.</p>
<p>It kept Arab Medium and Arab Heavy unchanged at Dated Brent -$3.15 and Dated Brent -$3.80 respectively.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8185</p>
